Addresses review feedback about unused `createdOrder` variable assignment in unit tests.

**Changes:**
- `CreateOrder_ShouldCreateOrder`: Use `createdOrder` in assertions to verify the returned order
- `GetOrderById_ShouldReturnOrder`, `GetOrderById_ShouldReturnNull`: Replace unused assignment with discard pattern

```csharp
// Before: variable assigned but never used
var createdOrder = _orderService.CreateOrder(testRecord);
var result = _repository.GetOrderById(orderId);
Assert.NotNull(result);

// After: use returned value in assertions
var createdOrder = _orderService.CreateOrder(testRecord);
Assert.NotNull(createdOrder);
Assert.Equal(orderId, createdOrder.Id);

// Or discard when return value not needed
_ = _orderService.CreateOrder(testRecord);
```

